  "name": "Unarmed Master",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/question-stone-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a master of using unarmed combat, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls you make with unarmed strikes.</li><li>Before you make an unarmed strike, you can choose to take a -5 penalty to the attack roll. If the attack hits, you add +10 to the attack's damage.</li><li>Additionally the size of your unarmed strike becomes one die size larger (d4 => d6, etc.). If you do not already have a roll for the damage of your unarmed strikes, it becomes a d4. The maximum damage dice you can have for an unarmed strike is 1d12.</li></ul>",
